# RR2c-2a (critical_qualifier_receivers_bug; steps/qualifier-receivers-20261010.md): `immutable` over the merge
# protects the value: a write through the qualified binding's own name is refused at translation (an alias meets the
# run-time guard, unit_rr2_qualified_merge_alias_write).
Integer:
    int: value 0
end: Integer
fn: m () int
    a: independent: const: immutable: merge(Integer  int: value 7)
    a\value: 9
    return: a\value
end: m
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: m(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
